     "library": {
      "uid": "d536f8faea294202a0dbf555e644fce3",
      "title": "12U 19-inch open-frame server rack, 600x600x653 mm",
      "area": "Electronics",
      "named": "12U rack frame 600x600x653",
      "source": "assistant",
      "description": "Frame of a 12U, 19-inch four-post open server rack. The footprint is 600 x 600 mm and the height 653.4 mm, built from 40x40 mm box-section corner posts with top and bottom width and depth members, on four levelling feet. Frame: x centred, front at y=0, z up. U1 starts at z=70. It goes with the '19in EIA-310 rails, 12U' part (front rail faces at y=50, rear at y=550, hole centres 465.1 mm apart, three 9.5 mm square cage-nut holes per U at 6.35, 22.225 and 38.1 mm). It also goes with the rail bracket plates, the 60 mm corner gussets and a 2U vented cantilever shelf with rack ears.",
      "tags": [
       "server rack",
       "12U",
       "19 inch",
       "EIA-310",
       "network cabinet",
       "open frame",
       "rack"
      ]
     }
